.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct libnbft_subsystem_ns" "August 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct libnbft_subsystem_ns \- Subsystem Namespace (SSNS) info
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct libnbft_subsystem_ns {
.br
.BI "    int index;"
.br
.BI "    struct libnbft_discovery *discovery;"
.br
.BI "    struct libnbft_security *security;"
.br
.BI "    int num_hfis;"
.br
.BI "    struct libnbft_hfi **hfis;"
.br
.BI "    char transport[8];"
.br
.BI "    char traddr[40];"
.br
.BI "    char *trsvcid;"
.br
.BI "    __u16 subsys_port_id;"
.br
.BI "    __u32 nsid;"
.br
.BI "    enum libnbft_nid_type nid_type;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 *nid;"
.br
.BI "    char *subsys_nqn;"
.br
.BI "    __u16 trflags;"
.br
.BI "    int controller_id;"
.br
.BI "    int asqsz;"
.br
.BI "    char *dhcp_root_path_string;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 naed;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 cipeec;"
.br
.BI "    __u16 cto;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 nceec;"
.br
.BI "    __u16 flags;"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "index" 12
SSNS Descriptor Index in the descriptor list.
.IP "discovery" 12
Primary Discovery Controller associated with
this SSNS Descriptor.
.IP "security" 12
Security Profile Descriptor associated with
this namespace.
.IP "num_hfis" 12
Number of HFIs.
.IP "hfis" 12
List of HFIs associated with this namespace.
Includes the primary HFI at the first position
and all secondary HFIs. This array is null-terminated.
.IP "transport" 12
Transport Type string (e.g. 'tcp').
.IP "traddr" 12
Subsystem Transport Address.
.IP "trsvcid" 12
Subsystem Transport Service Identifier.
.IP "subsys_port_id" 12
The Subsystem Port ID.
.IP "nsid" 12
The Namespace ID of this descriptor or when \fInid\fP
should be used instead.
.IP "nid_type" 12
Namespace Identifier Type, see \fIenum libnbft_nid_type\fP.
.IP "nid" 12
The Namespace Identifier value.
.IP "subsys_nqn" 12
Subsystem and Namespace NQN.
.IP "trflags" 12
Transport Specific Flags bitmask,
see \fIenum nbft_ssns_trflags\fP.
.IP "controller_id" 12
Controller ID (SSNS Extended Information Descriptor):
The controller ID associated with the Admin Queue
or 0 if not supported.
.IP "asqsz" 12
Admin Submission Queue Size (SSNS Extended Information
Descriptor) or 0 if not supported.
.IP "dhcp_root_path_string" 12
DHCP Root Path Override string (SSNS Extended
Information Descriptor).
.IP "naed" 12
Namespace Availability Enhanced Diagnostic
(SSNS Extended Information Descriptor). Provides
additional status codes from the pre-OS driver when
the namespace is unavailable.
See \fIenum nbft_ssns_ext_info_naed\fP for values.
Zero indicates no additional information.
Only present in NBFT rev. 1.1+, zero otherwise.
.IP "cipeec" 12
Connect Invalid Parameters Extended Error Code
(SSNS Extended Information Descriptor). Provides
additional error detail when the pre-OS driver
received a Connect Invalid Parameters status.
See \fIenum nbft_ssns_ext_info_cipeec\fP for values.
Zero indicates no extended error.
Only present in NBFT rev. 1.1+, zero otherwise.
.IP "cto" 12
Connection Timeout in seconds (SSNS Extended
Information Descriptor). The timeout value used
by the pre-OS driver for connecting to the object
specified with this SSNS descriptor. A value of
0xFFFF indicates that no timeout was specified.
Zero indicates either a timeout of zero seconds
or that the field is not present (NBFT rev. 1.0).
.IP "nceec" 12
Network and Connection Extended Error Code
(SSNS Extended Information Descriptor). Provides
error codes specific to network and connection
errors encountered by the pre-OS driver.
See \fIenum nbft_ssns_ext_info_nceec\fP for values.
Zero indicates no extended error.
Only present in NBFT rev. 1.1+, zero otherwise.
.IP "flags" 12
SSNS Flags bitmask, see \fIenum nbft_ssns_flags\fP.
